{"n":112,"ar":["قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ"],"en":["Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One,","Allah, the Eternal Refuge.","He neither begets nor is born,","Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\""],"uz":["Ayt: «U Alloh yagonadir.","Alloh — Comaddir.","U tug`magan va tug`ilmagan.","Va Unga hech kim teng bo`lmagan»."]}